 or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213647,"global_rank":254599,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40218},{"name":"IreneYIN7/AI_Projects","owner":"IreneYIN7","html_url":"https://github.com/IreneYIN7/AI_Projects","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213646,"global_rank":254602,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40219},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":213641,"global_rank":254610,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40220},{"name":"michaelpeterswa/MethowTrailsAPIRequest","owner":"michaelpeterswa","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelpeterswa/MethowTrailsAPIRequest","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"brute force scraping and api request to gather Methow Trails snow report data","topics":[],"score":213638,"global_rank":254629,"on_pyp